    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFRAG. DESTROY. DELIVER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGITAL EXORCIST is a visual novel adventure game set in a world that blends late 20th century technology with advanced systems powered by occult magic. You play as a Digital Exorcist, solving supernatural crimes and eliminating digital demons along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Exorcise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate eerie crime scenes with the help of your digital companion, Tomodachi, as well as your newly assigned handler, Shinda Sakana. Collect evidence and uncover the hidden truth behind each incident. Forge deeper bonds with your students to unlock powerful abilities and items, turning their trust into the key to exorcising the demons haunting the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/91aa2eb0fb13c580582fd1f79a2cb167.poster.avif?t=1753752627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/91aa2eb0fb13c580582fd1f79a2cb167.webm?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/91aa2eb0fb13c580582fd1f79a2cb167.mp4?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Setting with Cultural Depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a Baja Japanifornia-style world, with Latin American sensibilities reflected in its political, economic, and social themes. You\u2019ll also find cultural elements drawn from both the U.S. and Japan, blending into a rich, alternate timeline full of personal and societal tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/717593c0a8bc233fb14e8f997828e672.poster.avif?t=1753752627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/717593c0a8bc233fb14e8f997828e672.webm?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/717593c0a8bc233fb14e8f997828e672.mp4?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Social Links and Daily Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a teacher, you'll engage in a daily routine: bond with students, uncover their personal struggles, and help them resolve their issues. These social links deepen your connection to the world and impact the narrative in meaningful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/68ee257e43590bd1ded9e8000b575a0c.poster.avif?t=1753752627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/68ee257e43590bd1ded9e8000b575a0c.webm?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/68ee257e43590bd1ded9e8000b575a0c.mp4?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's storylines are grounded in the real-life thoughts and experiences of the development team, offering personal, heartfelt, and sometimes painful insight into modern life. Developed by an international team of Hispanic creators, the story is enhanced with each contribution of their lived experiences and unique perspectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Refined Narrative Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGITAL EXORCIST delivers a tight, impactful narrative by refining the story game format. Drawing inspiration from classic adventure titles, it selectively builds on their strengths while streamlining the experience, resulting in a deeply engaging, emotionally rich journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/b2b37f58c63301dc4f25ee5f118b0ff2.poster.avif?t=1753752627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/b2b37f58c63301dc4f25ee5f118b0ff2.webm?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944390/extras/b2b37f58c63301dc4f25ee5f118b0ff2.mp4?t=1753752627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
